# Citation File Format — https://citation-file-format.github.io/
# GitHub reads this file to offer a "Cite this repository" button.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Political party WhatsApp channels: an open dataset of parties' WhatsApp presence across Europe"
abstract: >-
  An open dataset of European political parties' presence on WhatsApp — their
  Channels, groups and click-to-chat numbers — with public follower counts of
  their Channels tracked over time and ranked by city, region, country and
  continent. Follower counts are read from each Channel's own public preview
  page; failed reads are recorded as failures, never as zero. Covers political
  parties and their territorial branches only. Published under CC BY 4.0.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "WhaTools"
    website: "https://wha.tools"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/procom-dev/political-whatsapp-channels"
url: "https://wha.tools/political-parties-whatsapp-channels"
keywords:
  - WhatsApp
  - WhatsApp Channels
  - political parties
  - Europe
  - follower counts
  - social media
  - political communication
  - open data
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-31"
